  "2026-10-19T14:00:44.929Z",codex-agent,"Frontmatter kebab-case names are canonical keys; retained relative filenames provide legacy aliases and byte-preserving export. Descriptions now populate the native description field. Regression covers cross-file name links, aliases, missing targets and idempotence."
  "2026-10-19T14:07:32.510Z",codex-agent,"Behavioral revert proof: reverting only sourceDocument to the review baseline makes the link regression fail (1 failed, 0 passed), reporting 3 unresolved references instead of 1. Restored code passes the focused suite."
  "2026-10-19T14:30:04.512Z",codex-agent,"Final private proof: 281 files imported; 281 unchanged on re-import; 281 exports byte-identical. Unresolved occurrences fell from 129 to 36; independent canonical-name and file-alias audit confirms all 36 point to absent targets (33 unique targets). Private scratch artifacts deleted."
